WEBVTT

00:00.340 --> 00:01.740
so you can control remotely.

00:01.980 --> 00:04.100
You can move your head around to get a sense of depth.

00:04.920 --> 00:06.900
You can lower it, you can go higher,

00:06.940 --> 00:09.100
which is what you can't do with a 2D camera.

00:09.760 --> 00:12.220
And here we have an arm in Singapore,

00:12.780 --> 00:15.800
and I can lift it and control it remotely.

00:17.000 --> 00:19.280
And what it'll let me do is if I want to pick up,

00:19.280 --> 00:21.620
say, this pink cube, I can look to the left

00:22.180 --> 00:25.280
and line up the claw so that it's lined up

00:25.280 --> 00:28.140
with a pink cube, whereas here it would be harder to tell.

00:28.440 --> 00:30.760
But now I'm absolutely certain because I can look around.

00:30.860 --> 00:31.960
So now if I close the claw,

00:32.620 --> 00:34.400
I can easily pick up the pink cube.

00:35.430 --> 00:36.990
Once we have the pink cube,

00:38.910 --> 00:43.450
then I can pick it up and I can look around.

00:45.510 --> 00:48.470
I can look to the side and see that there is in fact,

00:49.470 --> 00:50.630
space over the hole.

00:51.570 --> 00:53.370
And once I have it lined up on both fronts,

00:53.730 --> 00:56.030
I can just let go and boom.

00:57.970 --> 01:00.910
We now have the pink cube inside the cup.
